From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: voidforge <voidforge@valuz.io>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:59:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] openarc: embedder: history search and search suggestions for
 the command bar

Plan B66. OACProfile answers the command bar's history query
(HistoryService::QueryHistory, one row per URL, http/https only, empty for
off-the-record profiles) and fetches a search suggestion URL the shell built
(SimpleURLLoader on the profile's storage partition, no cookies, no cache,
1.5 s timeout, 64 KiB limit). Each call returns an OACAutocompleteRequest
whose -cancel runs the handler once with an empty result.
